Kazuma, sir, you rang for me?

262
00:11:33,130 --> 00:11:35,880
I would like my morning coffee,
please, Sebastian.

263
00:11:35,960 --> 00:11:37,290
[HEIDEL]
My name is Heidel, sir.

264
00:11:37,540 --> 00:11:38,920
If you could, Heidel.

265
00:11:41,420 --> 00:11:42,500
[sighs]

266
00:11:44,170 --> 00:11:45,710
[KAZUMA]
It's been a week, already.

267
00:11:46,000 --> 00:11:48,250
Won't be much longer
before Mary the Maid comes in

268
00:11:48,330 --> 00:11:50,290
to change the sheets. Hm.

269
00:11:50,540 --> 00:11:52,500
However, shall I make
her job more difficult,

270
00:11:52,580 --> 00:11:54,040
as any noble would?

271
00:11:54,670 --> 00:11:56,000
- [knocking on door]
- Huh.

272
00:11:56,750 --> 00:11:58,040
Here she comes.

273
00:11:58,170 --> 00:12:00,460
♪

274
00:12:02,130 --> 00:12:04,130
Ah, good morning, Mary!

275
00:12:04,250 --> 00:12:06,460
I know you're ready to do
the old sheet swap,

276
00:12:06,540 --> 00:12:08,880
but it's not gonna be quite
so easy for you this time.

277
00:12:09,290 --> 00:12:12,670
Now, if you want to make some
quick work of this little task

278
00:12:12,750 --> 00:12:16,130
then you have to say
"Master, I beg you

279
00:12:16,210 --> 00:12:19,290
please allow me to collect
the sheets with your..."

280
00:12:20,080 --> 00:12:21,380
[robe flutters]

281
00:12:23,750 --> 00:12:25,580
♪

282
00:12:25,750 --> 00:12:27,670
What is being
collected, exactly?

283
00:12:28,380 --> 00:12:30,540
May as well finish
your thought, go on.

284
00:12:31,000 --> 00:12:33,130
You have our
undivided attention, now.

285
00:12:33,630 --> 00:12:35,080
Finish what you were saying.

286
00:12:35,710 --> 00:12:39,380
[KAZUMA] Ma...
Master please allow me...

287
00:12:40,130 --> 00:12:42,790
to collect the sheets
with your scent on them so.

288
00:12:42,960 --> 00:12:45,380
[DARKNESS] "The sheets with
your scent on them so" what?

289
00:12:45,630 --> 00:12:48,420
I thought you were an expert
at sexually harassing people.

290
00:12:48,540 --> 00:12:50,500
Stop acting embarrassed
and say it.

291
00:12:50,710 --> 00:12:53,880
Ple... Please. Hang on!
Why are you guys even here?

292
00:12:54,170 --> 00:12:56,380
To drag you back home
with us, obviously!

293
00:12:56,460 --> 00:12:57,920
Megumin has been
so worried

294
00:12:58,000 --> 00:12:59,330
that she could
barely even sleep!

295
00:12:59,420 --> 00:13:00,670
That was only a coincidence!

296
00:13:00,750 --> 00:13:02,880
There's no need to cause
any weird misunderstandings!

297
00:13:02,960 --> 00:13:04,630
I'm promoted
to Iris's playmate!

298
00:13:04,710 --> 00:13:06,670
Finally, I've got
some stability and safety!

299
00:13:06,750 --> 00:13:07,880
So, you can all buzz off!

300
00:13:07,960 --> 00:13:09,000
You imbecile,

301
00:13:09,080 --> 00:13:11,080
that is not an official duty
in this country!

302
00:13:11,170 --> 00:13:13,630
Listen, this is totally unfair,
Kazuma!

303
00:13:14,080 --> 00:13:16,960
We brought down the Devil Kings
generals together, didn't we?

304
00:13:17,210 --> 00:13:19,080
So, if I don't get to live
in a fancy castle, too,

305
00:13:19,170 --> 00:13:20,580
then it's just not right!

306
00:13:20,790 --> 00:13:22,130
Stop talking, Aqua!

307
00:13:22,210 --> 00:13:24,000
You are confusing
the issue here!

308
00:13:24,790 --> 00:13:26,250
[IRIS] Excuse me.
[ALL] Huh.

309
00:13:26,330 --> 00:13:27,580
Princess Iris.

310
00:13:28,130 --> 00:13:29,500
I'm really sorry.

311
00:13:30,130 --> 00:13:32,330
I couldn't help
overhearing what you said.

312
00:13:32,420 --> 00:13:33,420
Hm.

313
00:13:35,380 --> 00:13:37,380
[DARKNESS] Though he may
be rather pitiful,

314
00:13:37,710 --> 00:13:41,330
in Axel, he has become a fairly
well-regarded adventurer.

315
00:13:42,250 --> 00:13:44,040
There are also those
who consider themselves

316
00:13:44,130 --> 00:13:46,500
his friends
and who worry about him.

317
00:13:47,790 --> 00:13:49,630
Which includes the three of us.

318
00:13:50,790 --> 00:13:54,580
Therefore, I must implore you
to please give him his leave.

319
00:13:55,380 --> 00:13:57,210
[KAZUMA]
You've gotta tell her no, Iris!

320
00:13:57,290 --> 00:13:59,290
"Big Brother is gonna
stay here in the castle

321
00:13:59,380 --> 00:14:01,000
so we can play together!"

322
00:14:01,330 --> 00:14:02,290
[IRIS] You're right.

323
00:14:02,380 --> 00:14:04,540
And I apologize
for being so selfish.

324
00:14:04,630 --> 00:14:05,710
[gasps]

325
00:14:05,790 --> 00:14:07,420
[KAZUMA] Tell em off, Iris,
you've got this!

326
00:14:07,500 --> 00:14:08,880
Come on, you're the only one

327
00:14:08,960 --> 00:14:10,670
with authority
in this whole castle!

328
00:14:10,750 --> 00:14:11,920
What you say goes!

329
00:14:12,080 --> 00:14:13,710
Time to show 'em
who's boss around here!

330
00:14:13,790 --> 00:14:15,460
I was wondering, Lalatina.

331
00:14:15,670 --> 00:14:16,670
[all gasp]

332
00:14:16,750 --> 00:14:18,790
If it would be okay
could I hold

333
00:14:18,880 --> 00:14:21,000
a special going away
banquet for him, tonight?

334
00:14:21,080 --> 00:14:22,130
[all gasp]

335
00:14:22,210 --> 00:14:24,130
[all groaning]

336
00:14:26,460 --> 00:14:27,750
- [thudding]
- [gasps]

337
00:14:27,830 --> 00:14:29,000
[IRIS] Konosuba!

338
00:14:29,250 --> 00:14:30,670
[indistinct chatter]

339
00:14:30,750 --> 00:14:32,000
[AQUA] Hey, hey, Kazuma!

340
00:14:32,080 --> 00:14:33,750
This stuff
is really incredible!

341
00:14:33,830 --> 00:14:35,420
It's all-natural wild melon

342
00:14:35,500 --> 00:14:37,250
that's topped
with some spicy ham!

343
00:14:37,330 --> 00:14:39,210
And it still tastes
super fresh!

344
00:14:39,330 --> 00:14:40,750
This is awesome, too!

345
00:14:40,880 --> 00:14:42,380
Sushi rice with flan on top,

346
00:14:42,460 --> 00:14:44,420
covered in wasabi
and soy sauce!

347
00:14:45,000 --> 00:14:47,130
Yeah, whatever,
good for you guys.

348
00:14:47,250 --> 00:14:50,290
[NOBLE 03-A (M)]
Oh, so beautiful, as always!

349
00:14:50,670 --> 00:14:53,380
Even a rare flower
that only blooms by moonlight

350
00:14:53,460 --> 00:14:55,830
pales in comparison
to your true radiance!

351
00:14:55,920 --> 00:14:58,500
- Yes, indeed!
- You flatter me so.

352
00:14:58,830 --> 00:15:02,380
By the way, have you found
a fiancé yet, Lady Dustiness?

353
00:15:02,630 --> 00:15:04,750
For, if you haven't met
that fortunate man.

354
00:15:04,830 --> 00:15:06,080
What is this?

355
00:15:06,170 --> 00:15:07,960
[NOBLE 03-A (M)] I have sought
her hand for ages now,

356
00:15:08,040 --> 00:15:10,710
so I should receive
preferential treatment!

357
00:15:11,040 --> 00:15:12,630
[KAZUMA] She's a real hit.

358
00:15:12,710 --> 00:15:14,460
- [ALDARP] This is preposterous.
- [gasps]

359
00:15:14,540 --> 00:15:18,000
You see, Lady Dustiness already
has an appropriate partner.

360
00:15:18,670 --> 00:15:21,630
- [ALL] Lord Aldarp!
- [chuckles]

361
00:15:21,710 --> 00:15:23,790
Hey, what the hell
are you even doing here, Pops?

362
00:15:23,880 --> 00:15:25,080
[ALDARP] Shut your mouth!

363
00:15:25,170 --> 00:15:27,630
As a consequence of you
sending the Destroyers core

364
00:15:27,710 --> 00:15:29,960
to my mansion
there are still repairs

365
00:15:30,040 --> 00:15:32,500
that have yet to be finished,
I'll have you know!

366
00:15:32,790 --> 00:15:34,290
I must ask who was the match

367
00:15:34,380 --> 00:15:36,000
for Lady Dustiness
you spoke of?

368
00:15:36,080 --> 00:15:38,460
Still chasing after
Darknesss tail, old man?

369
00:15:38,540 --> 00:15:40,630
That's "Lord Aldarp" to you!

370
00:15:40,710 --> 00:15:41,710
[scoffs]

371
00:15:41,790 --> 00:15:43,830
And there's only one man
who's worthy of taking

372
00:15:43,920 --> 00:15:46,330
the hand of Lady Dustiness
in matrimony.

373
00:15:46,580 --> 00:15:49,580
He's currently doing battle
against the Devil Kings forces

374
00:15:49,670 --> 00:15:51,250
while wielding a sacred sword!

375
00:15:51,330 --> 00:15:52,710
The first prince, Jatice!

376
00:15:52,790 --> 00:15:53,920
[all gasp]

377
00:15:54,000 --> 00:15:56,210
[ALDARP] The kingdom's
champion, Prince Jatice,

378
00:15:56,290 --> 00:15:58,460
and Lady Dustiness,
who has slain

379
00:15:58,540 --> 00:16:00,170
the Devil Kings
generals of late.

380
00:16:00,250 --> 00:16:02,580
What better pairing
could there possibly be?

381
00:16:02,670 --> 00:16:04,540
Yes, that's true.

382
00:16:04,750 --> 00:16:06,250
[NOBLE 03-A (M)] Who could be
better suited to her

383
00:16:06,330 --> 00:16:08,330
than First Prince Jatice?

384
00:16:08,750 --> 00:16:11,330
[indistinct chatter]

385
00:16:13,170 --> 00:16:14,290
[sighs]

386
00:16:15,330 --> 00:16:18,420
Hey, what about the steamy
affair we're having?

387
00:16:18,540 --> 00:16:21,250
Great, Lalatina,
you're just gonna ditch me?

388
00:16:21,330 --> 00:16:22,920
[gasping]

389
00:16:23,000 --> 00:16:24,460
What are you talking about?

390
00:16:24,580 --> 00:16:26,670
Were those intimate moments
just some kinda joke?

391
00:16:26,750 --> 00:16:28,040
You called me "Master"
just the other day...

392
00:16:28,130 --> 00:16:29,330
[grunting]

393
00:16:29,420 --> 00:16:30,920
[all gasp]

394
00:16:31,080 --> 00:16:32,670
I must warn you
all this teasing

395
00:16:32,750 --> 00:16:34,540
could cost you quite dearly!

396
00:16:34,630 --> 00:16:37,250
I'd be careful
if I were you, Lalatina!

397
00:16:37,330 --> 00:16:38,960
Showing how tough
you really are

398
00:16:39,040 --> 00:16:40,500
might just scare
all the boys off...

399
00:16:40,580 --> 00:16:41,710
[screaming]

400
00:16:41,790 --> 00:16:43,500
[all gasp]

401
00:16:43,670 --> 00:16:44,790
[DARKNESS] Oh, my goodness!

402
00:16:44,880 --> 00:16:47,290
You certainly are
a convincing actor!

403
00:16:47,500 --> 00:16:50,460
[indistinct chatter]

404
00:16:50,670 --> 00:16:52,290
[KAZUMA]
I didn't mean any harm.

405
00:16:52,380 --> 00:16:54,250
Well, not much, anyway.

406
00:16:54,330 --> 00:16:56,290
I just saw
how upset Darkness looked

407
00:16:56,380 --> 00:16:58,380
and ended up saying
some weird stuff.

408
00:17:00,080 --> 00:17:03,920
Hey, isn't this supposed
to be my big going-away party?

409
00:17:04,380 --> 00:17:07,330
They're all in there having
a great time without the star!

410
00:17:07,580 --> 00:17:09,830
Well, he's right here,
that's where the star is!

411
00:17:09,920 --> 00:17:11,000
Right here!

412
00:17:11,130 --> 00:17:12,080
[gasps]

413
00:17:12,170 --> 00:17:15,040
Um, shouldn't you be inside,
what are you doing out here?

414
00:17:15,500 --> 00:17:17,830
Iris, you're so amazing!

415
00:17:18,170 --> 00:17:20,670
Being alone at a party
can totally wreck your ego!

416
00:17:20,750 --> 00:17:23,040
Oh, you're the best ever,
little sis!

417
00:17:23,380 --> 00:17:24,540
Come on.

418
00:17:24,880 --> 00:17:25,920
- Hm.
- Huh.

419
00:17:26,080 --> 00:17:27,750
[AQUA] And for my next trick,

420
00:17:27,830 --> 00:17:30,500
I'll take this ordinary glass
right from the table...

421
00:17:30,580 --> 00:17:33,170
She's doing her whole
"performer" thing, again.

422
00:17:34,130 --> 00:17:35,130
[chuckles]

423
00:17:36,040 --> 00:17:37,040
Huh.

424
00:17:41,290 --> 00:17:44,500
After tomorrow, this castle
is going to be so quiet.

425
00:17:45,670 --> 00:17:48,210
Claire won't be upset,
and nobody will be causing

426
00:17:48,290 --> 00:17:50,540
trouble for Rain,
any longer, either.

427
00:17:51,000 --> 00:17:52,540
You make it sound
like a good thing

428
00:17:53,670 --> 00:17:56,130
I honestly have no idea
what you see in me.

429
00:17:56,960 --> 00:17:59,710
Simple...
you aren't like the others.

430
00:18:00,040 --> 00:18:03,080
Everybody dotes on me,
but you never do.

431
00:18:03,330 --> 00:18:05,670
You're rude and so honest.

432
00:18:06,000 --> 00:18:07,330
Though I'm a royal,
you've taught me

433
00:18:07,420 --> 00:18:09,040
such strange things.

434
00:18:09,290 --> 00:18:10,830
You're so immature
and desperate

435
00:18:10,920 --> 00:18:12,080
to win against me.

436
00:18:12,250 --> 00:18:14,580
Hey, I wasn't asking you
to roll out

437
00:18:14,670 --> 00:18:16,250
a huge list of complaints.

438
00:18:16,330 --> 00:18:18,170
I was kinda hoping to find out
all the stuff

439
00:18:18,250 --> 00:18:19,500
you like about me.

440
00:18:19,580 --> 00:18:22,790
Right, and that's exactly what
I've been trying to tell you.

441
00:18:23,380 --> 00:18:24,380
[chuckles]

442
00:18:25,040 --> 00:18:27,130
[KAZUMA]
She's so freaking cute!

443
00:18:28,460 --> 00:18:30,420
[IRIS] With all the time
we've spent together,

444
00:18:30,580 --> 00:18:33,000
I just know it's something
that I'll never forget.

445
00:18:34,040 --> 00:18:35,790
I'm envious of Lalatina.

446
00:18:37,830 --> 00:18:41,170
I'm sure she must enjoy
every single day.

447
00:18:41,630 --> 00:18:42,630
Huh.

448
00:18:44,000 --> 00:18:45,290
[KAZUMA] When tomorrow comes,

449
00:18:45,380 --> 00:18:48,210
she'll start acting like
a princess all over again.

450
00:18:48,460 --> 00:18:50,170
Pretending to be a "good girl"

451
00:18:50,250 --> 00:18:51,830
who never has
a selfish thought.

452
00:18:53,170 --> 00:18:55,250
There's gotta be some way
that I can stay here

453
00:18:55,330 --> 00:18:56,540
at the castle.

454
00:18:57,330 --> 00:18:59,540
[IRIS] Maybe if I could
be an adventurer.

455
00:19:00,290 --> 00:19:01,460
Did you know?

456
00:19:01,710 --> 00:19:04,040
The royal family's
always shown potential in magic

457
00:19:04,130 --> 00:19:05,710
and some other talents too.

458
00:19:05,790 --> 00:19:07,130
So even though
I might not be able

459
00:19:07,210 --> 00:19:09,380
to be a Crusader like Lalatina,

460
00:19:09,500 --> 00:19:12,000
maybe I can still be
a magic user or a priest?

461
00:19:12,170 --> 00:19:14,290
[giggles]
I'd be the kind of adventurer

462
00:19:14,380 --> 00:19:16,420
who'd even surprise you,
Elder Brother!

463
00:19:17,500 --> 00:19:20,750
Or maybe I could choose
to become a thief,

464
00:19:20,830 --> 00:19:22,500
like the one around here
that everybody's been

465
00:19:22,580 --> 00:19:23,920
talking about lately!

466
00:19:24,250 --> 00:19:25,080
[gasps]

467
00:19:25,170 --> 00:19:26,540
But, Claire
would be upset with me

468
00:19:26,630 --> 00:19:28,750
even if I were
only a noble thief.

469
00:19:29,130 --> 00:19:30,500
- [KAZUMA] What'd you say?
- [gasps]

470
00:19:31,460 --> 00:19:32,880
About the noble thief?

471
00:19:34,080 --> 00:19:36,750
Well, uh, there's one
who only targets nobles

472
00:19:36,830 --> 00:19:38,540
with corrupt reputations.

473
00:19:38,960 --> 00:19:40,830
And after every robbery,
they always make

474
00:19:40,920 --> 00:19:42,830
a sizeable donation
to an orphanage

475
00:19:42,920 --> 00:19:44,580
that's run by the Eris Church.

476
00:19:47,460 --> 00:19:48,460
Huh.

477
00:19:49,630 --> 00:19:50,830
Elder Brother?

478
00:19:50,920 --> 00:19:54,830
[KAZUMA] Jackpot baby!

479
00:19:54,920 --> 00:19:55,960
Konosuba!

480
00:19:56,040 --> 00:19:58,380
I would love to spar with you
and then possibly...

481
00:19:58,460 --> 00:20:00,880
- [gasps]
- Darkness!

482
00:20:01,040 --> 00:20:02,540
[KAZUMA]
Oh, good timing, Claire.

483
00:20:03,000 --> 00:20:04,580
W-what are you talking about?

484
00:20:04,710 --> 00:20:07,170
Apparently a thief's been
hassling the nobles

485
00:20:07,250 --> 00:20:08,630
around the capital, right?

486
00:20:08,830 --> 00:20:10,130
That, that's true.

487
00:20:10,460 --> 00:20:13,630
The ones with unsavory
reputations are under fire.

488
00:20:14,130 --> 00:20:15,710
That's about to change!

489
00:20:15,790 --> 00:20:17,920
'Cause I'm nabbing
this "noble thief"!

490
00:20:18,080 --> 00:20:19,080
- Huh?
- Huh?

491
00:20:19,630 --> 00:20:21,250
The same thief
no one's been able

492
00:20:21,330 --> 00:20:23,290
to secure any leads on, whatsoever?

493
00:20:23,380 --> 00:20:25,750
Who is this
unsavory-looking fellow?

494
00:20:25,830 --> 00:20:27,250
Seems unremarkable to me.

495
00:20:27,330 --> 00:20:29,960
[KAZUMA] Uh, thanks guys,
I'm right here ya know.

496
00:20:30,330 --> 00:20:32,170
And I don't care
if his intentions are good!

497
00:20:32,250 --> 00:20:34,170
'Cause a thief is a thief
in my book!

498
00:20:34,250 --> 00:20:37,040
Since when have you had
such a strong sense of justice?

499
00:20:37,210 --> 00:20:39,920
These people need saving
so I'm staying here!

500
00:20:40,000 --> 00:20:42,130
Hey,
you're really unbelievable!

501
00:20:42,210 --> 00:20:43,880
[NOBLE 03-A (M)] Spectacular!

502
00:20:43,960 --> 00:20:46,540
Clearly, you are a comrade
of Lady Dustiness!

503
00:20:46,630 --> 00:20:48,790
Not that I've ever done
anything shameful enough

504
00:20:48,880 --> 00:20:51,670
to dare raise the noble thief's
ire myself, of course.

505
00:20:51,880 --> 00:20:53,000
Nor have I!

506
00:20:53,080 --> 00:20:54,920
I've never once
been unscrupulous!

507
00:20:55,000 --> 00:20:56,830
Thus there'll be no target
aimed at my back.

508
00:20:56,920 --> 00:20:59,130
[KAZUMA] These guys
couldn't be more obvious.

509
00:20:59,750 --> 00:21:01,210
- [gasps]
- Aah!

510
00:21:01,330 --> 00:21:02,420
[KAZUMA] Oh, I get it!

511
00:21:02,500 --> 00:21:04,920
You can't wait to see
your beloved "elder brother"

512
00:21:05,000 --> 00:21:06,630
in action, can you?

513
00:21:06,790 --> 00:21:08,290
Well, just leave it to me!

